WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.000 line:10%
A physical model demonstrates the front controller
and the wireless rear-light unit.

00:14.000 --> 00:35.000 line:10%
Normal illumination changes between riding and parking.
The riding pattern combines red light and two green LEDs.

00:35.000 --> 00:49.000 line:10%
A and B operate the left and right turn signals.
The turning side uses an amber light sequence.

00:49.000 --> 01:00.000 line:10%
SOS provides a local light-and-sound alarm.
It does not send a remote rescue message.

01:00.000 --> 01:22.000 line:10%
Acceleration changes support braking alerts.
Detection performance still requires physical testing.

01:22.000 --> 01:40.287 line:10%
This is a working prototype.
Formal accuracy and battery-runtime measurements are pending.
